        <label>Submit for Approval</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>134</locationY>
        <actionName>submit</actionName>
        <actionType>submit</actionType>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>objectId</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>processDefinitionNameOrId</name>
            <value>
                <stringValue>AF_AP_Quote_DiscountTiers</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>submit</nameSegment>
    </actionCalls>
    <apiVersion>61.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <description>After-save on Quote, paired with the before-save AF_FL_Quote_SetDiscountApprovalStatus. Submits the record into AF_AP_Quote_DiscountTiers only on the transition into Pending, never on a later unrelated save while already Pending, since re-submitting an in-flight approval request errors. Renamed from the original AF_AP_Quote_Discount when that process needed a genuine 4-tier rebuild to match the confirmed DoA matrix - Salesforce permanently locks an approval process&apos;s steps once it has any submission history, so a new process was required rather than editing in place.

LFRDN-761 fix: AF_AP_Quote_DiscountTiers routes to the Owner&apos;s Manager, but this org&apos;s sharing is Private/BU-group-based, not role-hierarchy - a Manager outside the Opportunity&apos;s BU had no access. Quote sharing is Controlled By Parent (the Opportunity), so only the Opportunity needs an explicit share, not the Quote itself. Added Get_Owner_User/Get_Manager to resolve the Owner&apos;s Manager, then Share_Opportunity_With_Manager (same OpportunityShare/Edit/Manual pattern as LFRDN-707/728/762) before Submit_For_Approval.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Quote Submit Discount Approval {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Quote Submit Discount Approval</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>Share_Opportunity_With_Manager</name>
        <label>Share Opportunity With Manager</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>106</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Submit_For_Approval</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OpportunityAccessLevel</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Edit</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
